<title>USA: IMN Financial to buy Valley Financial.</title>
<headline>IMN Financial to buy Valley Financial.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMN Financial Corp said Thursday it signed a letter of intent to buy Valley Financial Funding LLC of Phoenix.</p>
<p>The mortgage banking company, which did not disclose the deal's details, said Valley Financial had more than $35 million in loan closings in 1996.</p>
<p>IMN changed its name from NGT Enterprises Inc May 15, when it effected a one-for-four reverse split.  The company's stock traded at 3-7/8 Thursday afternoon, up 3/8.</p>
